make('w12i.js',12,'INDIA','Kinan in India','The portal dropped Glitchy in India, where Annie grew up. She shows the family her home: the wheat fields of Punjab, Amritsar, the old Delhi bazaar, the Pink City of Jaipur and Amber Fort, a stepwell, the Kerala backwaters, the tiger reserve, the Taj Mahal by moonlight, and Mumbai in the monsoon.','Wheat fields, a tractor, the Golden Temple (a backdrop), bazaar stalls, pink walls, Amber Fort, a stepwell, houseboats, a tiger, the Taj Mahal, the Gateway of India, the airport.', india_props, india)

